# Anchor Core implementation

- Binary/package name must remain `anchor` (Dockerfile copies `target/release/anchor`).
- Shell out to `git` and `tmux` via `tokio::process::Command` — do not add `git2` for worktrees in v1.
- Sync must be idempotent; never force-overwrite dirty/diverged worktrees.
- Re-sync must never kill live tmux panes.
- No database in v1 — filesystem + git + tmux are sources of truth.
- When spawning agent panes, strip `GITHUB_TOKEN` from the pane environment.
